-- Item definitions. Profiles intentionally resolve magical actions to registered
-- Magic Runtime spell IDs rather than embedding execution logic; melee weapons
-- name a MeleeProfiles archetype. Rolled rarity and affixes live on item
-- instances (see ItemRules), never here.
--
-- Category: Weapon | Armor | Consumable | Material
-- EquipSlot: MainHand | MagicFocus | Head | Body | Legs (Consumables go in Quick slots)

